        "properties": {
          "integrity": {
            "required": [
              "signature",
              "key_id",
              "signed_fields"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-7.8 — an intervening outcome records exactly one of an intervention (a performable directive) or an advisory (one that is not). Requiring an intervention outright, as an earlier version did, left MA-7.4's advisory classification with no record shape it could be true in — and so contradicted TV-8.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "decision_outcome": {
            "enum": [
              "block",
              "attenuate",
              "escalate",
              "abstain"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "decision_outcome"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "enforcement_status"
        ],
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "required": [
              "intervention"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "enforcement_status": {
                "enum": [
                  "requested",
                  "acknowledged",
                  "applied",
                  "failed"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "advisory"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "enforcement_status": {
                "const": "not_performable"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-7.9 — `not_performable` is its own state. Collapsing it into `failed` would claim an attempt, and into `not_required` would claim the decision did not call for the effect. Both are measurements nobody took.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "enforcement_status": {
            "const": "not_performable"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "enforcement_status"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "advisory"
        ],
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "intervention"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-7.1 — an advisory control is not an intervention, so the two never appear together and an advisory never carries a live enforcement state.",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "advisory"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "intervention"
          ]
        },
        "properties": {
          "enforcement_status": {
            "const": "not_performable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-7.8 — `allow` declined to intervene, so it carries neither an intervention nor an advisory, and the only status it can hold is the one that says enforcement was not required.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "decision_outcome": {
            "const": "allow"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "decision_outcome"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "enforcement_status": {
            "const": "not_required"
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "intervention"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "advisory"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-5.6 — where the mechanism is the hash itself, the algorithm named and the digest's own prefix are the same claim and must agree. Under a signature mechanism they differ legitimately: the digest names the hash, `algorithm` names the signature scheme.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "integrity": {
            "properties": {
              "mechanism": {
                "enum": [
                  "hash",
                  "hash_chain"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "mechanism"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "integrity"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "integrity": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "properties": {
                  "algorithm": {
                    "const": "sha256"
                  },
                  "digest": {
                    "pattern": "^sha256:"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "algorithm": {
                    "const": "sha384"
                  },
                  "digest": {
                    "pattern": "^sha384:"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "algorithm": {
                    "const": "sha512"
                  },
                  "digest": {
                    "pattern": "^sha512:"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "algorithm": {
                    "const": "blake2b"
                  },
                  "digest": {
                    "pattern": "^blake2b:"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "algorithm": {
                    "const": "blake3"
                  },
                  "digest": {
                    "pattern": "^blake3:"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "MA-7.7 — an advisory recommends a mechanism, and the same compatibility holds for a recommendation as for a performed directive. Permitted under `block`: block.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "decision_outcome": {
            "const": "block"
