    {
      "$comment": "MA-5.6 — a chain entry carries its link to the preceding entry, or it is the genesis entry and declares itself so. The two are mutually exclusive: a record carrying both says at once that nothing precedes it and what precedes it.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "integrity": {
